            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lovestohost"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was nice, though I must admit, as written it's a little perplexing to me. It's too much for a shooter, yet not enough (and too sweet) for a \"cocktail\" (though it's called a \"cocktail\"). I solved this by simply topping it off w/Diet 7-Up for a very enjoyable cocktail. Cheers!"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
