            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Timothy Sutton"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a southern classic!\nExpect sweet!!!\nTo some the name suggests a shooter but it is a Collins glass cocktail. Slammer refers to its dangerously deceptive sweet over strong nature.",
